---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---

<PublicLayout
  seo={{
    title: 'Privacy Policy - Data Security & Consumer Rights | Teepul',
    description: 'Learn how Teepul (Ashank Ecommerce Pvt Ltd) safeguards customer data. Full compliance with the Information Technology Act 2000 and DPDP Act 2023. Zero data selling.',
    canonicalUrl: '/privacy-policy',
  }}
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f7f4ef] via-[#faf8f4] to-[#f4efe6] text-slate-900 overflow-hidden py-14 lg:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-amber-900/10">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-amber-900/10 border border-amber-900/20 text-amber-900 text-xs font-black px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>🔒 Data Protection & Trust</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">
        Privacy <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-800 via-amber-700 to-amber-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Policy</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Your privacy is sacred. We enforce strict data protection protocols under Indian cyber law and never sell your personal information.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Legal Content -->
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 space-y-10 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">1.</span> Commitment & Legal Scope
        </h2>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Ashank Ecommerce Private Limited</strong> (operating the brand <strong>Teepul</strong>, hereinafter referred to as "we", "our", or "us") collects, uses, stores, and protects your information when you visit <a href="https://teepul.com" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline font-semibold">https://teepul.com</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          We comply strictly with the <strong>Information Technology Act, 2000</strong>, the <strong>Information Technology (Reasonable Security Practices and Procedures and Sensitive Personal Data or Information) Rules, 2011 (SPDI Rules)</strong>, and the <strong>Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act)</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">2.</span> Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p>To process your orders and enhance your browsing experience, we collect:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong>Personal Contact Information:</strong> Your full name, delivery address, city, state, pin code, mobile number, and email address provided during checkout or account registration.</li>
          <li><strong>Order & Transaction History:</strong> Records of products purchased, drapery sizing chosen, delivery address preferences, and payment transaction identifiers.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical & Browsing Data:</strong> Internet Protocol (IP) address, device type, browser specifications, and approximate geographic location (city and state) used solely to prevent cart abandonment fraud and calculate delivery estimations.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">3.</span> Payment Security & Non-Storage of Financial Data
        </h2>
        <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-2xl p-4 text-emerald-950 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-800">
            <span>🛡️ 256-Bit SSL Encryption & Zero Card Storage</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs">
            We <strong>NEVER store, log, or have access to</strong> your credit/debit card numbers, CVV codes, UPI PINs, or net banking credentials on our servers.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs">
            All online transactions are processed securely through RBI-authorized, PCI-DSS Level 1 certified payment gateways (<strong>Paytm PG</strong> and <strong>Razorpay</strong>) using bank-grade TLS 1.3 encryption.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">4.</span> How We Use Your Information
        </h2>
        <p>We process your personal information only for legitimate business purposes:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>Fulfilling, packing, and dispatching your curtain orders from our Panipat production center.</li>
          <li>Communicating order confirmations, invoice receipts, and live courier AWB tracking via SMS, WhatsApp, and email.</li>
          <li>Processing return requests, doorstep replacement pickups, and refund bank transfers.</li>
          <li>Preventing suspicious transactions, bot scraping, and fraudulent COD orders.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">5.</span> Third-Party Disclosure & Zero Data Selling
        </h2>
        <p>
          <strong>We never sell, rent, trade, or monetize your personal data to advertisers or third parties.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          Your delivery details are shared solely with verified logistics partners (including <strong>EKart Logistics, Blue Dart, Delhivery</strong>) for the strict purpose of completing doorstep delivery.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">6.</span> Cookies & Cart Session Storage
        </h2>
        <p>
          We use essential HTTP cookies and secure session storage to keep track of items in your shopping cart, authenticate customer login sessions, and measure page loading performance. You may disable cookies in your web browser, though doing so may disable cart functions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">7.</span> Your Consumer Privacy Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          Under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you have the right to request access to the personal data we hold about you, request rectification of inaccurate data, or request the deletion of your account and personal history (except where retention is required by Indian tax or commercial law). To exercise your rights, email <a href="mailto:support@teepul.com" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline font-bold">support@teepul.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">8.</span> Grievance Officer
        </h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with the Information Technology Act, 2000 and Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020, the contact details of our Grievance Officer are:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-800 space-y-1">
          <div><strong>Grievance Officer:</strong> Customer Redressal Cell</div>
          <div><strong>Operating Company:</strong> Ashank Ecommerce Private Limited</div>
          <div><strong>Address:</strong> Plot No. 142, Sector-25, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Phase-2, Panipat, Haryana – 132103, India</div>
          <div><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:grievance@teepul.com" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline">grievance@teepul.com</a></div>
          <div><strong>Response Timeline:</strong> Acknowledgment within 48 hours; resolution within 30 days.</div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>
